        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Orca Security ’s tool covers over 900 cloud models (the resource types Sonar tracks, such as an Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) instance or an Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
