      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To solve this, Orca Security partnered with AWS to build Discovery AI, a natural language query agent on Amazon Bedrock .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Orca Security’s Sonar query system supports 900+ cloud infrastructure and application models with complex relationships between them.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To build this capability, the Orca team set out to build a natural language interface that can generate valid Sonar queries from plain text.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To address this, the Orca team designed and deployed a solution that handles thousands of queries per day at 15-second response times using Amazon Bedrock.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The system converts natural language questions into valid Discovery filters through a multi-stage pipeline, with each stage matched to the most appropriate Amazon Bedrock model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:50.274Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Figure 1: Multi-stage Discovery AI pipeline architecture showing the flow from natural language input to validated Discovery filter queries using foundation models on Amazon Bedrock",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/natural-language-security-queries-at-orca-security-using-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T16:03:31.000Z",
