      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To get started building similar solutions, explore Amazon Bedrock for foundation model (FM) access, Cohere Rerank on Amazon Bedrock for retrieval optimization, and Amazon Titan for embeddings.",
